    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;SANAE's Sylphid Breeze&quot; is a Touhou fan game with cute pixelart. With \u201cSPELL SPOILER&quot; she has created new ability, she inhales enemies and imitates their ability.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>How shady!\u00a0A mysterious shadow looms over the Moriya shrine!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Someone has attacked <strong>Lady Kanako</strong>, the goddess of the <strong>Moriya Shrine</strong>!<br>In addition, the symbol of the Moriya, the sacred pillar &quot;<strong>Onbashira</strong>&quot;, has also been stolen!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The culprit could be <strong>Marisa</strong>, the familiar black-and-white thief, or the <strong>Myouren Temple</strong>, business rival, or even the <strong>Celestial</strong> with fearless smile.....!?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3200060/extras/bd053a1bca5288920d5e024b35612a4b.avif?t=1752230221\" width=600 height=180 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>How quick! SANAE's basic actions</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SANAE can run through the GENSOUKYOU nimbly through actions such as dash, jump and sliding. When faced with a high platform that is difficult to climb or a hole that leads to an abyss, she uses the miraculous wind to levitate herself up and over! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>How strong! SANAE's new ability \u201cSPELL SPOILER\u201d!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3200060/extras/PV_gif_steam01_640x360_fr30.GIF?t=1752230221\" width=600 height=180 /></span>With use SPELL SPOILER, she can inhale enemies that appear along the way and to get their ability. After get a new spell, SANAE transforms into the form of the enemies. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3200060/extras/a9027fcd62042d8b4d915c44e6578ea2.poster.avif?t=1752230221\" width=160 height=80 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3200060/extras/a9027fcd62042d8b4d915c44e6578ea2.webm?t=1752230221\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SANAE's adorable appearance drown by pixelart is also noteworthy.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Let's run! Racing Battle!</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3200060/extras/b41cda33a658125e5b5a7d2da6b2a332.poster.avif?t=1752230221\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3200060/extras/b41cda33a658125e5b5a7d2da6b2a332.webm?t=1752230221\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3200060/extras/b41cda33a658125e5b5a7d2da6b2a332.mp4?t=1752230221\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the mini-game\u201cTENGU RUMEI RACE&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SANAE and MARISA race on a course in the mountain of YOKAI.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The key to victory is how well you run on the rugged mountain path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you run gracefully, The TENGU take pictures of your great run!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3200060/extras/1d26e5d95c97cc4278a773479a787351.poster.avif?t=1752230221\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3200060/extras/1d26e5d95c97cc4278a773479a787351.webm?t=1752230221\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3200060/extras/1d26e5d95c97cc4278a773479a787351.mp4?t=1752230221\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Let's fight!\u3000Shooting Battle! </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3200060/extras/PV_gif_0_640x360_fr15.GIF?t=1752230221\" width=640 height=360 /></span>At times, the enemies will challenge SANAE to an aerial battle! <br>In aerial battles, she can move freely up, down, left, and right. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And, she can not only fire &quot;OFUDA&quot; in rapid succession, but also use the power of KANAKO to unleash a powerful blow! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the above actions to your advantage, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let's enjoy the journey of exterminating enemies together with SANAE!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>This story is fully voiced!!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please enjoy SANAE's dialogue unbounded by common sense!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25a0Main Characters</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3200060/extras/0c2d3ab40ac0fc56cf4c8c8838d54bf5.avif?t=1752230221\" width=120 height=135 /></span>\u00a0Sanae Kochiya - VA:Saho Shirasu</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3200060/extras/63d1be184207590aed066cb732ba8ed9.avif?t=1752230221\" width=120 height=120 /></span>\u00a0Marisa Kirisame - VA:Mai Kanazawa</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3200060/extras/38f84fce53e8a0a24a06de18cc393b3f.avif?t=1752230221\" width=180 height=150 /></span>\u00a0Kanako Yasaka - VA:Noriko Shibasaki</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3200060/extras/f009977102e5e38ab75ce33e07ab664d.avif?t=1752230221\" width=140 height=120 /></span>\u00a0Suwako Moriya - VA:Risa Sekiguch</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3200060/extras/57c1ef2f1d41762a552c9ba7c6567fef.avif?t=1752230221\" width=120 height=120 /></span>\u00a0Tenshi Hinanawi - VA:Ayaka Murata</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3200060/extras/c6504e7f1119fc999dcc971d613bbb36.avif?t=1752230221\" width=120 height=120 /></span>Aya Syameimaru - VA:Kanamai's Friend &quot;I&quot;</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A challenge to you! Spell card battles!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the game progresses, bosses use their spell cards as like the original Touhou!!<br>Make use of Spell Spoiler to defeat the their Danmaku!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A help for you! BREEZE Mode!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If turn on Breeze Mode, reduce the damage you take and drop health items from certain enemies. If you are new to the action, or if the bosses give you a hard time, this mode will help. With this mode, you'll be safe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>*Note:</strong> BREEZE mode cannot be toggled during boss fights. If you fall down, head to the options before the next challenge.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Streaming &amp; Recording Guidelines</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel free to stream and record any part of the game.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please credit \u201cSANAE's Sylphid Breeze\u201d in your title or description.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No monetized redistribution of game assets without permission.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monetization via ads, donations, sponsorships, etc., is permitted.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;SANAE's Sylphid Breeze&quot; is a Touhou fan game with cute pixelart. With \u201cSPELL SPOILER&quot; she has created new ability, she inhales enemies and imitates their ability.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>How shady!\u00a0A mysterious shadow looms over the Moriya shrine!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Someone has attacked <strong>Lady Kanako</strong>, the goddess of the <strong>Moriya Shrine</strong>!<br>In addition, the symbol of the Moriya, the sacred pillar &quot;<strong>Onbashira</strong>&quot;, has also been stolen!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The culprit could be <strong>Marisa</strong>, the familiar black-and-white thief, or the <strong>Myouren Temple</strong>, business rival, or even the <strong>Celestial</strong> with fearless smile.....!?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3200060/extras/bd053a1bca5288920d5e024b35612a4b.avif?t=1752230221\" width=600 height=180 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>How quick! SANAE's basic actions</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SANAE can run through the GENSOUKYOU nimbly through actions such as dash, jump and sliding. When faced with a high platform that is difficult to climb or a hole that leads to an abyss, she uses the miraculous wind to levitate herself up and over! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>How strong! SANAE's new ability \u201cSPELL SPOILER\u201d!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3200060/extras/PV_gif_steam01_640x360_fr30.GIF?t=1752230221\" width=600 height=180 /></span>With use SPELL SPOILER, she can inhale enemies that appear along the way and to get their ability. After get a new spell, SANAE transforms into the form of the enemies. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3200060/extras/a9027fcd62042d8b4d915c44e6578ea2.poster.avif?t=1752230221\" width=160 height=80 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3200060/extras/a9027fcd62042d8b4d915c44e6578ea2.webm?t=1752230221\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SANAE's adorable appearance drown by pixelart is also noteworthy.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Let's run! Racing Battle!</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3200060/extras/b41cda33a658125e5b5a7d2da6b2a332.poster.avif?t=1752230221\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3200060/extras/b41cda33a658125e5b5a7d2da6b2a332.webm?t=1752230221\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3200060/extras/b41cda33a658125e5b5a7d2da6b2a332.mp4?t=1752230221\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the mini-game\u201cTENGU RUMEI RACE&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SANAE and MARISA race on a course in the mountain of YOKAI.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The key to victory is how well you run on the rugged mountain path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you run gracefully, The TENGU take pictures of your great run!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3200060/extras/1d26e5d95c97cc4278a773479a787351.poster.avif?t=1752230221\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3200060/extras/1d26e5d95